   "reason": "The Dragon's attack set is queen rays plus knight squares, so detonating her is the largest blast in the game (attack set + ring 2 at T4+); the pair converts the game's shortest-lived summon into an immediate room clear plus a 2-3 turn stun. | Enemies rate an ally queen as highly as Rookie, so a Duchess normally dies in a turn; while Rookie is smoked the king cannot flee her threats and the summon's captures do NOT break the smoke (only Rookie's own do), so the queen can carve while Rookie stays invisible.",
